// Title: AD FS DKM Key Read from Active Directory (4662)
// ATT&CK: T1606.002 | Tactic: CredentialAccess | Sigma id: 7568592d-cedc-4ac3-ad1b-0e7340a1650c
// Data source: SecurityEvent 4662 (Windows Security Events connector)
// Severity: Medium
// False positives: The AD FS service account reading its own key (exclude it by SubjectUserName)
// Suggested analytics rule: run every 15m, look back 30m, alert when results > 0.
// Entity mapping: Host = Computer, Account = SubjectUserName
// The time filter below is for ad-hoc hunting; the analytics rule's lookback applies when scheduled.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where EventID == 4662 and Properties contains "8d3bca50-1d7e-11d0-a081-00aa006c33ed"
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, SubjectUserName, SubjectDomainName, ObjectName, AccessMask, Properties
